    "title": "Police Log - Oct. 16, 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "36 minutes ago On Sept. 22 at about 12:20 a.m., Sgt. Arthur Peiteruti saw a vehicle drive through a properly coned-off construction zone at the intersection of Atwood Avenue and Cherry Hill Road. Peiteruti decided to terminate the pursuit of the vehicle and its driver after obtaining a license plate number and being able to positively identify the driver. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
